{"Deletes cached DLSS, Streamline, and component staging files to free disk space. Shaders, installed addons, and version metadata are preserved. Files are re-downloaded automatically when needed.":{"translation":"删除缓存的 DLSS、Streamline 和组件暂存文件以释放磁盘空间。着色器、已安装附加组件和版本元数据会保留；需要时会自动重新下载。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"768a994a232f016960f0e9e4dee8082e807530beba478ad36a341243290d7b98"},"Purge Staging Files":{"translation":"清理暂存文件","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"e6b3f1e8357cf437dc5da41f8c918092b778d35a2795187c25ec3476db73bb40"},"Deletes cached DLSS, Streamline, and download files to free disk space. Shaders are preserved.":{"translation":"删除缓存的 DLSS、Streamline 和下载文件以释放磁盘空间。着色器会保留。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"82c38ee03a835c11a9987f8bdf7e3e408bcd4228be573f8fe38e6ad75e1807e0"},"Admin Mode":{"translation":"管理员模式","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"972df38998ea4089ec1174e1d73e8d87ff017128bba011a32ec6e33deb662d6e"},"Creates a scheduled task to launch RHI with elevated privileges. Required for ReBAR, Low Latency Ultra, and Smooth Motion driver settings. The Drop Helper enables Discord drag-and-drop when running elevated.":{"translation":"创建计划任务，以提升权限启动 RHI。ReBAR、超低延迟和 Smooth Motion 驱动设置需要管理员权限。提升权限运行时，Drop Helper 可启用 Discord 拖放。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"966f7890c17addca7d2ad1869648c14170c6b0d1dfb19e7cafe5559771302cf4"},"Drop Helper":{"translation":"Drop Helper","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"ed869c4444cfdeb7bbee5d2ce516c974ba1b7d32beb09e4ae6ab501b13106ccb"},"The drop helper window enables Discord drag-and-drop in admin mode. Disable if you don't need it. Restart required.":{"translation":"Drop Helper 窗口可在管理员模式下启用 Discord 拖放。不需要时可禁用。需要重启。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"78268a91220e1f7143d033a93fb2dcdf21e33c24efbed7fbec250695679cea61"},"System Tray":{"translation":"系统托盘","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"2a2a416f22c1b78b6138d1904f67b680795d09b996684a47e09f217abc062d92"},"Minimize to system tray on close. Right-click the tray icon or pinned taskbar icon to quickly launch recent games.":{"translation":"关闭窗口时最小化到系统托盘。右键托盘图标或固定的任务栏图标，可快速启动最近使用的游戏。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"c0420c6c8bb7e248ee4f98dca9ffc934359c1ca7ddcc023ad074d77699cca7b2"},"Close to Tray":{"translation":"关闭到托盘","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"7188281eb8f2d45185d0c14768c14f7d3d77e4624eec9980cb41cd2d5cb8e7a1"},"Recent Games":{"translation":"最近游戏","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"976fa9abb53564b3d5746bff30dcd78c75001f863fe66bc2e1b5f4d517e1be3c"},"Start with Windows":{"translation":"开机启动","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"0bfcd9317d0d439103d99966cfa0fc130b2b2aab4035fc319cd096f0c90e305e"},"Data & Custom Files":{"translation":"数据与自定义文件","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"dad810b04304bc2950af3985b0d5fd8256cdaabb78a599a68edfee657255e4df"},"All RHI data is stored in AppData. Drop custom ReShade, DLSS, or Streamline DLLs into the Custom folder to use them as per-game overrides. The Logs folder contains session usage logs useful for troubleshooting.":{"translation":"RHI 的所有数据都存储在 AppData。将自定义 ReShade、DLSS 或 Streamline DLL 放入 Custom 文件夹，可作为单游戏覆盖使用。Logs 文件夹中保存用于排查问题的会话日志。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"ef14cbbcae3ee36211f04c06b43909b4e45cde02b65eff92983ff7e7cf7386c9"},"AppData Folder":{"translation":"AppData 文件夹","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"a6cc3903058f2302a943201f8010934cb1693ef263dcdbddc0a69ac37f6702ad"},"Downloads Folder":{"translation":"下载文件夹","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"0fc067cc18db764a525ec36b341a4b1ef87e9743f118839423d32faa48896c18"},"Custom Folder":{"translation":"自定义文件夹","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"137a8f09733b3fb9d5e54aae1bc2aa28e4419b06f8e87fe902afa5dab5e47757"},"Logs Folder":{"translation":"日志文件夹","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"17c2f0abdb88aa73594d2c6e8e378c7f363a7df235755e80ec0d344f109ba12c"},"Copy Logs":{"translation":"复制日志","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"9b8b83d186bed431e7f5445e1dc161697e9d57a3af0493bef2755514bb591b07"},"Creates a zip archive of all logs and copies it to clipboard — paste directly into Discord":{"translation":"将所有日志打包为 ZIP 并复制到剪贴板——可直接粘贴到 Discord","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"b1003c04692d59baa7c878bda365128e5f872d12e93f5ba5ca7787e0c071fe42"},"Export Game Data":{"translation":"导出游戏数据","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"08247f6366e80c2df4c1119ba10b918d525909dcefe9c678c31ccaf0e1580356"},"Gathers game library data (APIs, exe paths, engine info) and copies a JSON file to clipboard — paste into Discord to share with the RHI community database":{"translation":"收集游戏库数据（API、EXE 路径、引擎信息）并将 JSON 文件复制到剪贴板——可粘贴到 Discord 与 RHI 社区数据库共享","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"ad3404e7adc048b91457bce775b5a9ea5669a1e4cff1f04eff2e6bf6e13a6dd0"},"The all-in-one game enhancement toolkit for PC. Auto-detects games from 8 storefronts and provides one-click management for ReShade, HDR mods, shaders, DLSS/Streamline, frame limiters, NVIDIA driver profiles, and more — all from one place.":{"translation":"PC 一体化游戏增强工具箱。可自动检测 8 个游戏平台中的游戏，并在一个界面中一键管理 ReShade、HDR 模组、着色器、DLSS/Streamline、帧率限制器、NVIDIA 驱动配置文件等。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"5bd43d77c1b9a6de5184bb5d99896e88946112bcaf9d273f2b5ab02d6c3e53db"},"What RHI manages":{"translation":"RHI 可管理的内容","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"a565ceb60db21eae54875d5553c13b84cdb1adc67d2897fdfa8388a26cf9fff2"},"ReShade & shader packs · RenoDX HDR mods · Luma Framework · DLSS/Streamline version swaps & presets · NVIDIA driver profile settings (VSync, Low Latency, ReBAR, Smooth Motion, Power) · OptiScaler · ReLimiter & Display Commander frame limiters · RE Framework · DXVK · UE-Extended native HDR · Per-game overrides for everything.":{"translation":"ReShade 与着色器包 · RenoDX HDR 模组 · Luma Framework · DLSS/Streamline 版本切换与预设 · NVIDIA 驱动配置文件设置（垂直同步、低延迟、ReBAR、Smooth Motion、电源）· OptiScaler · ReLimiter 与 Display Commander 帧率限制器 · RE Framework · DXVK · UE-Extended 原生 HDR · 各项功能的单游戏覆盖。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"77f8596ecda6f16b661cd46e0ba7c11c191acdef51a5d0b4b8d63c7f8bbd1a7b"},"Single-player only":{"translation":"仅限单人游戏","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"9adde7f0e05ed194783adc76a677d5dc4aaa05b6b7b27f40a25539ad87209c3e"},"RHI installs ReShade with full addon support, OptiScaler, and can swap DLSS/Streamline DLLs. These modifications may be flagged by anti-cheat in online or multiplayer games. Uninstall ReShade, OptiScaler, and restore DLSS/Streamline defaults before playing online.":{"translation":"RHI 会安装支持完整附加组件的 ReShade、OptiScaler，并可替换 DLSS/Streamline DLL。这些修改在在线或多人游戏中可能被反作弊系统识别。进行在线游戏前，请卸载 ReShade、OptiScaler，并恢复 DLSS/Streamline 默认文件。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"45b4aebdec2aec06557489c871eed731a5c05d55040321b94ba455ee1376499b"},"Credits & Acknowledgements":{"translation":"致谢","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"44fa92878ff93e1fc51b0cddb6c2facf7dc68c5dcafbea9b5bd98e77cdf24d17"},"This app would not exist without the work of the following people and projects.":{"translation":"没有以下人员和项目的工作，就不会有这个应用。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"f708055b5be835d2e104fa40f34996533f3aca862d76217be79a50bdfae57c77"},"HDR mod framework powering 800+ games. The entire reason this app exists.":{"translation":"为 800 多款游戏提供支持的 HDR 模组框架，也是这个应用诞生的主要原因。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"a57ccf60942c16364b0303f0774c83984ebcfc1a82f8dde2c807288563c7f884"},"github.com/clshortfuse/renodx":{"translation":"github.com/clshortfuse/renodx","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"3f2240bbfaa99d3ee0fa10f05859d53ce864b55f28d7c29a15a01c4452b0555b"},"Post-processing injection framework. Downloaded with full addon support from reshade.me and cached locally. Copyright © Crosire.":{"translation":"后处理注入框架。从 reshade.me 下载支持完整附加组件的版本并在本地缓存。Copyright © Crosire。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"e4a2c2e99780cfecb28960fcdb6287a596739fa761b3ff8c0cc146cd9acab95d"},"reshade.me  ·  github.com/crosire/reshade":{"translation":"reshade.me  ·  github.com/crosire/reshade","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"35d029decb074741c763e08052ea12ef00ed28f7bdd3d5eaa4b6a1abd052a969"},"DX11 modding framework adding HDR support and graphics improvements via the ReShade addon system. Mods are downloaded from official GitHub releases. Drag-and-drop install with auto-detection, update checking, and per-game toggle.":{"translation":"通过 ReShade 附加组件系统为 DX11 游戏增加 HDR 支持和画质改进的模组框架。模组从官方 GitHub Release 下载，支持拖放安装、自动检测、更新检查和单游戏开关。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"935ab534e4cade7b28a1d50e963787442976dd58274eccabdd49ac09bb6d145b"},"github.com/Filoppi/Luma-Framework":{"translation":"github.com/Filoppi/Luma-Framework","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"25f9bad7b502c5fbe92ba1edea885dd568d96de27f058cb6808530432dba6fca"},"Archive utility used to extract ReShade DLLs from the NSIS installer. 7z.exe and 7z.dll are bundled under the LGPL licence. Copyright © Igor Pavlov.":{"translation":"用于从 NSIS 安装程序中提取 ReShade DLL 的压缩工具。随附的 7z.exe 和 7z.dll 使用 LGPL 许可证。Copyright © Igor Pavlov。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"71d0bf5ffa75293ffb0dc980d2951398f0314daf7020409b72f00cace7e6c1f0"},"7-zip.org  ·  LGPL-2.1 / BSD-3-Clause":{"translation":"7-zip.org  ·  LGPL-2.1 / BSD-3-Clause","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"8e5738ed742aa0a735963fddda11cf6445bf33e4028cc108ea84d504b10a33ae"},"HTML parser used to scrape game data from the RenoDX wiki. Copyright © ZZZ Projects Inc.":{"translation":"用于从 RenoDX Wiki 抓取游戏数据的 HTML 解析器。Copyright © ZZZ Projects Inc.。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"5f8f1ba5edf31c3b04ffb48f28f73cb1174f0ada8d5c3f5594d2d9fdde4584a4"},"github.com/zzzprojects/html-agility-pack":{"translation":"github.com/zzzprojects/html-agility-pack","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"15c945ff492ba5d5e224760bc3a374e021e93ff9cd0c888962ac7ab589552ed2"},"MVVM helpers (ObservableObject, RelayCommand, etc.) used throughout the app. Copyright © .NET Foundation.":{"translation":"应用中广泛使用的 MVVM 辅助库（ObservableObject、RelayCommand 等）。Copyright © .NET Foundation。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"3431b9b81d8c721db4c0af6099ae7a9721def6eb39c45876be3d1a8ec853c560"},"github.com/CommunityToolkit/dotnet":{"translation":"github.com/CommunityToolkit/dotnet","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"94