Flowering/dxvk","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"312ca58c2503f306bdf37191db6a2df0867f8021daba1f2321e0f8a2842bb244"},".NET wrapper for NVIDIA's NvAPI used for all driver profile management — DLSS presets, render scale, ReBAR, VSync, Smooth Motion, and more.":{"translation":"NVIDIA NvAPI 的 .NET 封装，用于全部驱动配置文件管理——包括 DLSS 预设、渲染比例、ReBAR、垂直同步、Smooth Motion 等。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"ab243728133d64b1980f8ebcadf4e5f8dda3f786940746f67f1a8adcc4bcf75f"},"github.com/falahati/NvAPIWrapper":{"translation":"github.com/falahati/NvAPIWrapper","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"03f9600e3fdd183cdf0ddd4a0656265ee5bf8c7a9fb1f1f21cb7b4662ccc3870"},"Somehow I have become a UI guy in multiple aspects of life lol.":{"translation":"不知不觉，我在生活的好几个方面都成了做 UI 的人，哈哈。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"a3c6fc759934e3f326c7f476473e92ad90b1aaffaf49b8ee8a0e916774111314"},"https://github.com/lazorr410":{"translation":"https://github.com/lazorr410","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"146d31fcac7f2933d2d05dc0d59e8d981cc3733a5baf2f873a73736702bd1b4e"},"Fixes depth-of-field stepping and tiling artifacts in Unreal Engine 5 games.":{"translation":"修复 Unreal Engine 5 游戏中的景深分层和拼接伪影。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"010336e81868133df95de15cb30b2fa72dd5a80a331ba34471dc420e99e2bbcb"},"github.com/RankFTW/rhi-repo":{"translation":"github.com/RankFTW/rhi-repo","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"bcb5ef05f5f5b71684a8313d84e123a45e819895901c353452eb115c1d194eb8"},"Unofficial companion app. Not affiliated with RenoDX, Crosire, or pmnoxx.":{"translation":"非官方配套应用，与 RenoDX、Crosire 或 pmnoxx 无隶属关系。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"99c4afcc27bf1b92acade74488a33571f4a839606ccf3e77e73c24f0d0e5f9e5"},"github.com/RankFTW":{"translation":"github.com/RankFTW","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"47f9e84fd57fe7fc71a9faf5d3c3ab1405e905857efeebe19bce1a03b29cd399"},"RenoDX Project — github.com/clshortfuse/renodx":{"translation":"RenoDX 项目 — github.com/clshortfuse/renodx","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"c5dd86ce88ab16f23ce677